s multiple parties**. Deed transferred 11/9/2021 to "PINON MARIA & 100%" but payment records show fragmentation: MARIA PINON paid 2025, CATALINA GRANADOS paid 2024, ANTONIO GRANADOS paid 2023, MCKNIGHT TITLE paid 2021 (likely closing escrow), and ROBBIE N SANCHES paid 2020 (prior owner). The current defendants are ANTONIO GRANADOS SOLORZANO (unserved, residing at 4632 Bunny Lane, Wylie) and MARIA DELOSANGELES GRANADOS PINON (served at 1018 Greenbriar Drive, Garland – **neither lives at the subject property**). The absence of homestead exemption and scattered payment names across relatives suggests a distressed family hand-off situation, possibly informal inheritance or failed investment. Maria made a $350 payment on 06/30/2026 after being served, indicating she acknowledges the debt but lacks full payoff capacity. Antonio remains unserved despite citation issued 05/26/2026, signaling avoidance or bad address.\n\n---\n\n## 2. FINANCIAL PICTURE\n\nFiled amount was **$4,370.39** (100% Garland ISD taxes: $2,444.26 base + $1,576.13 penalty/interest) covering 2022-2025 delinquencies. Current live DCAD balance shows **$0.00**, meaning Maria''s June 2026 payment of approximately $350 was credited but the bulk remains due through the lawsuit. The','\n',char(10)),NULL,'pre_judgment',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-07-04T20:03:57.463645','2026-07-07T12:42:01.437373','2026-07-07T12:42:01.437373',1,'individual','high','BEING 0.3326 ACRES, MORE OR LESS, STONEWALL COVE ADDITION, AKA 4660 STONEWALL COVE, TEXAS AS RECORDED IN INSTRUMENT 202100337164, OF THE DALLAS COUNTY DEED RECORDS.','{"account_number": "44022520010020000", "market_value": 39960, "land_value": 39960, "improvement_value": 0, "estimated_annual_taxes": 681.31, "year_built": null, "effective_year_built": null, "actual_age": null, "building_class": "", "construction_type": "", "foundation": "", "roof_type": "", "roof_material": "", "exterior_wall": "", "living_area_sqft": null, "total_area_sqft": null, "bedrooms": null, "bat