',NULL,0,'2027-03-01',NULL,NULL,NULL,'dallas',NULL,'[{"entity": "City of Dallas", "taxAmt": 4463.45, "penaltyInterest": 2338.22, "total": 6801.67}]',replace('# ACQUISITION INTELLIGENCE MEMO\n**PC Peak Development – Tax Foreclosure Analysis**\n\n**Case:** TX-26-01367 | **Property Account:** 00000701230000000  \n**Defendant:** Melvin M. Lockhart et al. | **Court:** 162nd District (Judge Ginsberg)  \n**Filed:** July 6, 2026 | **Analyst:** Senior Acquisition Team | **Date:** January 2025\n\n---\n\n## 1. PROPERTY & OWNER SITUATION\n\nThis is a **pure land play with zero structure value**. DCAD shows market value of $208,650 with improvement value effectively at zero—the distress signals explicitly note "likely vacant lot or demolished." The missing year built, square footage, and exterior data confirm no improvements exist for assessment purposes. The lot-to-improvement ratio is 100:0, making this raw land in Dallas city limits. Melvin M. Lockhart acquired via deed transfer February 13, 1995 (30 years ago) and maintained consistent tax payments from 2005-2022, with attorney fees paid in 2010 suggesting prior tax trouble that was resolved. The 17-year payment streak ending in 2022 indicates a triggering event—likely death, incapacity, or financial collapse. No homestead exemption confirms this was never owner-occupied; likely held as investment or inherited land. \n\nThe defendant roster reveals a **probate/estate situation**: Randall Lee Lockhart, Cynthia Lockhart McDonald, and Randi Niccole Lockhart are almost certainly Melvin''s children with "Address Unknown" for Melvin and Randall suggesting death or disappearance. Sebastian Properties LLC and Adalia Alvarez Rodriguez (in rem only) suggest either a failed purchase contract, easement holder, or junior lienholder. The prior suit reference 98-30757-T-L indicates Melvin fought and likely won a tax case in 1998, showing he previously cared enough to litigate. The current situation—three years non-payment starting 2023, citation by posting requested for multiple parties—signals the family is fragmented, unaware, or unable to resolve this.\n\n---\n\n## 2. FINANCIAL PICTURE\n\nFiling amount was $21,464.72 (July 2026) but **live tax balance is now $22,012.59**—a modest $547.87 increase over approximately 6 months indicating penalties are accruing at roughly 10-12% annually. The tax breakdown shows $6,801.67 owed to City of Dallas with $2,338.22 in penalties/interest on $4,463.45','\n',char(10)),NULL,'pre_judgment',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-07-07T12:37:58.401228','2026-07-07T12:37:58.401228','2026-07-07T12:37:58.401228',1,'individual','high','','{"account_number": "00000701230000000", "market_value": 208650, "land_value": 208650, "improvement_value": 0, "estimated_annual_taxes": 4646.03, "year_built": null, "effective_year_built": null, "actual_age": null, "building_class": "", "construction_type": "", "foundation": "", "roof_type": "", "roof_material": "", "exterior_wall": "", "living_area_sqft": null, "total_area_sqft": null, "bedrooms": null, "bathrooms": "", "stories": "", "depreciation_pct": null, "desirability": "", "air_condition": "", "heating": "", "garage_sqft": null, "zoning": "INDUSTRIAL RESEARCH DISTRICT", "lot_frontage_ft": 124, "lot_depth_ft": 0, "lot_area_sqft": 13910.0, "land_unit_price": 15.0, "legal_description": "1: P J ALLEN 2: BLK 3/7233 LTS 7 & 8 3: 4: VOL95029/3712 DD020195 CO-DALLAS 5: 7233 003 00700 2007233 003 Deed Transfer Date: 2/13/1995", "owners": [{"name": "LOCKHART MELVIN M", "pct": 100}], "deed_transfer_date": "2/13/1995", "exemptions": "None", "no_homestead": true, "tax_rates": [], "current_tax_balance": 22012.59, "current_levy": 4646.04, "prior_year_due": 15433.78, "payment_history": [{"date": "2023-03-24", "amount": 165.84, "tax_year": "2010", "payer": "ATTY FEES"}, {"date": "2023-03-24", "amount": 71.5, "tax_year": "2010", "payer": "ATTY FEES"}, {"date": "2023-03-24", "amount": 54.01, "tax_year": "2010", "payer": "ATTY FEES"}, {"date": "2023-01-17", 